   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "By the chain rule, \\( h'(x) = u'(v(x)) \\cdot v'(x) \\). From the table, \\( v(3) = 4 \\), so the outer derivative is read in the row x = 4: \\( u'(4) = -3 \\).",
